<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Azure Latch</Major>
    <Description>This macro for the Azure Latch game in Roblox performs three sets of things. Before you even use this macro, make sure you have header mode enabled ingame by pressing E. This means the macro can't be binded to E. Once you are in header mode, the macro flicks the ball up, then headers it. Then, it jumps and dashes into the ball, headering it a second time. After that, it headers it a 3rd time. The original resolution is 1920 x 1080, with 800 DPI and 0.171 sensitivity in Roblox. For this macro to work, you want to hold W while it is running, and stop holding W for a split second before the 1st header so the rest can go along smoothly.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>MoveR 0 -210 1 -180
Delay 12 ms
MoveR 0 -210 1 -180
Delay 12 ms
